              "evidence": "Considering the BIP13 P2SH address has been defined in 2012",
              "reason": "The proposal is designed in relation to the existing base58 address scheme for P2SH introduced by BIP13, explicitly comparing native witness addresses to BIP13 P2SH addresses and reusing the same address-encoding style as the incumbent address workflow it aims to replace for segwit payments.",
